# Clean Architecture

- Put feature code in `lib/features/<feature>/{data,domain,presentation}`.
- Put shared infrastructure in `lib/core/`. Do not add global `screens/`, `models/`, `repositories/`, or `services/` folders.
- Dependency direction is presentation → domain and data → domain.
- Domain must not import Flutter UI, Dio, Hive, BLoC, GetIt, or another feature's data or presentation code.
- Pages compose widgets and send intents to a Cubit or Bloc. Pages do not call Dio, Hive, repositories, or use cases directly.
- Add a use case only when it contains a business rule. Do not add a class that only forwards a call.
- Keep one primary type per file.
